      {
        "id": "e9648924-ad32-4f45-a9c2-974f7a5af7b3",
        "title": "Worth the money",
        "text": "General reviews :\n1. It's a gaming laptop for sure, GPU and CPU workings are well optimized and also with Armoury Crate you can further customise as per your liking. Temparature is well controled thanks to the cooling system.\n2. Backlit keyboard is good and decent key travel though I have faced some conflict between dynamic lighting and Armoury Crate lighting for lighting style.\n3. The screen will flick when change in power source. Colour are vibrant as expected from Asus. You can change the tone via Armoury Crate.\n4. Sound is timid but clear.\n5. Did not faced connectivity issues.\n\nProblems I faced :\n1. Within 5 months screen blackout. \n2. Once the screen issue solved, One side Speaker stopped working\n\nCustomer care service:\n1. Solved screen issue within 4 days but they took the laptop with them and replaced some chips.\n2. For speaker issue they tried to troubleshoot remotely, when not fixed they send on-spot engineer and tested the speaker physically and found faulty speaker and ordered for a new pair and will be replaced at home (on progress) will take 3 - 4 days",
        "rating": 4,
